### Koffy API - Roasters Endpoints
### Make sure to replace {{token}} with your actual JWT token

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Get all roasters (user must be a member)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Pagination - Get first page (default: 20 items per page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters?page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Pagination - Get second page
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters?page=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Pagination - Custom items per page (10 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters?page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Pagination - Large page size (50 items)
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Create a new roaster (user becomes owner automatically)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roaster": {
    "name": "Café del Valle",
    "location": "Medellín, Colombia",
    "description": "Tostador artesanal especializado en cafés de origen colombiano",
    "active": true
  }
}

### 7. Get a specific roaster by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Update a roaster (only owner or manager)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roaster": {
    "name": "Café del Valle Premium",
    "location": "Medellín, Colombia",
    "description": "Tostador artesanal especializado en cafés especiales de origen colombiano"
  }
}

### 9. Delete a roaster (only owner)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get all members of a roaster
GET {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Add a member to a roaster with salary (only owner or manager)
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 2,
  "role": "barista",
  "salary": 1500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "salary_period": "monthly"
}

### 12. Update a member's role and salary (only owner or manager)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1/members/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "manager",
  "salary": 2500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "salary_period": "monthly"
}

### 12b. Add hourly worker
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 3,
  "role": "barista",
  "salary": 15.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "salary_period": "hourly"
}

### 12c. Add weekly paid worker
POST {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 4,
  "role": "member",
  "salary": 600.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "salary_period": "weekly"
}

### 13. Remove a member from a roaster (only owner or manager)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/roasters/1/members/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
### Pagination:
### The index endpoint supports pagination with the following query parameters:
### - page: Page number (default: 1)
### - per_page: Items per page (default: 20, maximum: 100)
###
### Example: GET /roasters?page=2&per_page=25
###
### Response includes pagination metadata:
### {
###   "data": [...],  // Array of roaster objects
###   "meta": {
###     "pagination": {
###       "current_page": 1,      // Current page number
###       "per_page": 20,          // Items per page
###       "total_pages": 5,        // Total number of pages
###       "total_count": 100,      // Total number of roasters
###       "next_page": 2,          // Next page number (null if last page)
###       "prev_page": null,       // Previous page number (null if first page)
###       "first_page": true,      // Is this the first page?
###       "last_page": false       // Is this the last page?
###     }
###   }
### }
###
### Available Roles:
### - member: Basic member - can view roaster info
### - barista: Can manage inventory and production
### - manager: Can manage operations and team
### - owner: Full control over the roaster
###

### Permission Matrix:
### Action                | Member | Barista | Manager | Owner
### ---------------------|--------|---------|---------|-------
### View roaster         |   ✓    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Edit content         |   ✗    |    ✓    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Update roaster       |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Invite members       |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Change roles         |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✓    |   ✓
### Delete roaster       |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✗    |   ✓
### Transfer ownership   |   ✗    |    ✗    |    ✗    |   ✓
